      "worked": "All expressions require $\\cos\\alpha\\cos\\beta\\cos\\gamma\\ne0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}1+\\sec^2\\alpha\\tan^2\\gamma&=1+\\frac{(1+\\tan^2\\alpha)\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}\\\\1+\\sec^2\\alpha\\tan^2\\gamma&=\\frac{\\cos^2\\gamma+\\sin^2\\gamma+\\tan^2\\alpha\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}\\\\1+\\sec^2\\alpha\\tan^2\\gamma&=\\frac{1+\\tan^2\\alpha\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}.\\end{align*}$$\nSimilarly,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}&=\\sec^2\\gamma+\\tan^2\\beta\\tan^2\\gamma\\\\\\frac{1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}&=1+(1+\\tan^2\\beta)\\tan^2\\gamma\\\\\\frac{1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma}{\\cos^2\\gamma}&=1+\\sec^2\\beta\\tan^2\\gamma.\\end{align*}$$\nTherefore\n$$\\begin{align*}(1+\\sec^2\\alpha\\tan^2\\gamma)(1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma)&=\\frac{(1+\\tan^2\\alpha\\sin^2\\gamma)(1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma)}{\\cos^2\\gamma}\\\\(1+\\sec^2\\alpha\\tan^2\\gamma)(1+\\tan^2\\beta\\sin^2\\gamma)&=(1+\\sec^2\\beta\\tan^2\\gamma)(1+\\tan^2\\alpha\\sin^2\\gamma).\\end{align*}$$",
